~ hint
Mélos: It is waiting for an answer. I must mimic that echo. These strings on the ground... if I jump on them, I can make them vibrate!
Harmony Guide: [HINT] String length determines pitch. Long strings are heavy and slow. Short strings are light and fast. It is pure mathematics!
=> END

~ lesson
Mélos: A page... it detached itself from the door's structure.
Harmony Guide: [BOOK PAGE OPENED]
Harmony Guide: LESSON I: THE DIMENSION OF SOUND. Length dictates the note.
Harmony Guide: Long String = Low Frequency. Larger objects vibrate slower, creating a Deep sound.
Harmony Guide: Short String = High Frequency. Smaller objects vibrate faster, creating a High sound.
=> END
